"OTM davlat granti (bakalavriat)": "State university grant (bachelor's)",
"Davlat oliy ta'lim muassasalarida bepul o'qish. Grant o'rinlari DTM test natijalari bo'yicha eng yuqori ball to'plaganlar o'rtasida taqsimlanadi. Test 5 fandan iborat, maksimal ball 189.": "Free study at state universities. Grant places go to the highest DTM test scores. The test has 5 subjects, maximum 189 points.",
"Hujjat topshirish": "Apply",
"Prezident davlat stipendiyasi": "Presidential state scholarship",
"Eng iqtidorli talabalar uchun oyiga 2 579 444 so'm (2026-yil 1-sentyabrdan). Talablar: barcha baholar a'lo, bakalavr talabalari uchun kamida 2 ta e'lon qilingan ilmiy ish. 2026/2027 o'quv yili uchun 187 ta o'rin. Arizalar har yili avgust oyida qabul qilinadi.": "For the most gifted students: 2,579,444 soum a month (from 1 September 2026). Requirements: all grades excellent, and at least 2 published papers for bachelor's students. 187 places for 2026/2027. Applications open every August.",
"Nomdor davlat stipendiyalari": "Named state scholarships",
"Islom Karimov, Alisher Navoiy va boshqa nomdor stipendiyalar. Talablar: \"3\" baho bo'lmasligi, \"4\" baholar ulushi 25 foizdan oshmasligi. 2026/2027 o'quv yili uchun Islom Karimov nomidagi stipendiyaga 194 ta, Navoiy nomidagisiga 175 ta o'rin ajratilgan.": "Islam Karimov, Alisher Navoi and other named scholarships. Requirements: no \"3\" grades and no more than 25% \"4\" grades. For 2026/2027 there are 194 Islam Karimov and 175 Navoi places.",
"El-yurt umidi jamg'armasi": "El-yurt umidi foundation",
"Dunyoning yetakchi universitetlarida bakalavriat, magistratura va doktorantura uchun to'liq moliyalashtiriladigan stipendiya. Talablar: IELTS kamida 6.0 (bakalavriat) yoki 7.0 (magistratura va doktorantura), xorijiy universitetning qabul xati. Ochiq tanlovlar yiliga ikki marta e'lon qilinadi (2026-yilda aprel va noyabr).": "A fully funded scholarship for bachelor's, master's and PhD study at leading universities worldwide. Requirements: IELTS 6.0 or higher (bachelor's) or 7.0 (master's and PhD), and an offer letter from a university abroad. Open rounds are announced twice a year (April and November in 2026).",
"Milliy sertifikatlar": "National certificates",
"Milliy sertifikat (fanlar)": "National certificate (subjects)",
"Bilim va malakalarni baholash agentligi beradi. Darajalar: A+ (70 va undan yuqori), A (65-69,9), B+ (60-64,9), B (55-59,9), C+ (50-54,9), C (46-49,9). OTMga kirishda A+ va A mutaxassislik fanidan maksimal ball beradi, boshqa darajalar mutanosib ball beradi; majburiy fanda istalgan daraja maksimal ball beradi.": "Issued by the Agency for Assessment of Knowledge and Skills. Grades: A+ (70 and above), A (65-69.9), B+ (60-64.9), B (55-59.9), C+ (50-54.9), C (46-49.9). For university entry, A+ and A give full points in a specialty subject and other grades give proportional points; in a compulsory subject any grade gives full points.",
"Chet tili milliy sertifikati (CEFR)": "National foreign language certificate (CEFR)",
"Bitta imtihon natijasiga ko'ra B1, B2 yoki C1 darajasi beriladi. B2 va C1 OTMga kirishda chet tili fanidan maksimal ball, B1 maksimal ballning 75 foizini beradi. Chet tili birinchi fan bo'lgan yo'nalishlarda sertifikat talab qilinadi, filologiya yo'nalishlari uchun C1 darajasi kerak.": "One exam gives a B1, B2 or C1 level. B2 and C1 give full points in the foreign language subject for university entry, and B1 gives 75%. Programmes where the language is the first subject require a certificate, and philology needs C1.",
"Xalqaro imtihonlar": "International exams",
"Ingliz tilini 4 ko'nikma bo'yicha baholaydi: Listening, Reading, Writing, Speaking. Natija 0 dan 9 gacha band, 2 yil amal qiladi. Academic (o'qish uchun) va General Training turlari bor. O'zbekistonda British Council va IDP o'tkazadi. 5.5 va undan yuqori OTMga kirishda chet tili fanidan maksimal ball beradi.": "Tests English in 4 skills: Listening, Reading, Writing, Speaking. Bands from 0 to 9, valid for 2 years. There are Academic (for study) and General Training versions. In Uzbekistan it is run by the British Council and IDP. 5.5 or higher gives full points in the foreign language subject for university entry.",
"ETS tashkiloti o'tkazadigan ingliz tili imtihoni, ayniqsa AQSh universitetlarida keng qabul qilinadi. 4 bo'lim, 0 dan 120 gacha ball, 2 yil amal qiladi.": "An English exam by ETS, widely accepted, especially by US universities. 4 sections, 0 to 120 points, valid for 2 years.",
"Uyda onlayn topshiriladigan ingliz tili testi, 10 dan 160 gacha ball, natija 2 kun ichida chiqadi, 2 yil amal qiladi. Ko'plab xorijiy universitetlar qabul qiladi.": "An English test taken online at home, 10 to 160 points, results within 2 days, valid for 2 years. Accepted by many universities abroad.",
"AQSh va boshqa davlatlar universitetlarining bakalavriatiga kirish uchun test: matematika hamda o'qish va yozish, 400 dan 1600 gacha ball. College Board raqamli shaklda o'tkazadi.": "An entry test for bachelor's study in the US and other countries: maths plus reading and writing, 400 to 1600 points. College Board runs it in digital form.",
"Magistratura va doktoranturaga kirish uchun test (ETS). Verbal va Quantitative bo'limlari 130 dan 170 gacha, Analytical Writing 0 dan 6 gacha baholanadi. Natija 5 yil amal qiladi.": "An entry test for master's and PhD study (ETS). Verbal and Quantitative are scored 130 to 170, Analytical Writing 0 to 6. Valid for 5 years.",
"MBA va biznes magistraturasiga kirish uchun test (GMAC). GMAT Focus Edition natijasi 205 dan 805 gacha, 5 yil amal qiladi.": "An entry test for MBA and business master's programmes (GMAC). GMAT Focus Edition scores run from 205 to 805 and are valid for 5 years.",
"Ma'lumotlar rasmiy manbalar asosida 2026-yil noyabr holatiga tayyorlandi. Muddat va talablarni ariza topshirishdan oldin rasmiy saytda tekshiring.": "Prepared from official sources as of November 2026. Check dates and requirements on the official site before you apply.",
