"Men qurilma yoki buyumni yig'ish, sozlash yoki tuzatib ko'rishni yoqtiraman.": "I like assembling, setting up or repairing devices and things.",
"Men asbob-uskunalar yoki texnika bilan ishlab, amaliy natija chiqarishni yoqtiraman.": "I like working with tools or machines and getting a practical result.",
"Men materiallardan foydalanib, qo'lim bilan biror narsa yaratishni yoqtiraman.": "I like making things by hand from materials.",
"Men faqat o'qib chiqishdan ko'ra, vazifani o'zim bajarib natijasini ko'rishni yoqtiraman.": "I would rather do a task myself and see the result than only read about it.",
"Men jadvaldagi ma'lumotlarni solishtirib, takrorlanayotgan qonuniyatlarni topishni yoqtiraman.": "I like comparing data in tables and finding patterns that repeat.",
"Men dastur yoki qurilmada xato chiqsa, sababini bosqichma-bosqich tekshirishni yoqtiraman.": "When a program or device fails, I like checking the cause step by step.",
"Men mavzuni chuqur o'rganib, xulosamni dalillar bilan tushuntirishni yoqtiraman.": "I like studying a topic in depth and explaining my conclusions with evidence.",
"Men mantiqiy, matematik yoki dasturlash masalasining yechimini izlashni yoqtiraman.": "I like looking for solutions to logic, maths or programming problems.",
"Men biror g'oyani rasm, video yoki boshqa vizual kontentga aylantirishni yoqtiraman.": "I like turning an idea into a picture, video or other visual content.",
"Men hikoya, reklama matni, sarlavha yoki brend uchun ta'sirli so'zlar topishni yoqtiraman.": "I like finding strong words for a story, an ad, a headline or a brand.",
"Men ranglar, shriftlar va sahifa ko'rinishining turli variantlarini sinab ko'rishni yoqtiraman.": "I like trying different colours, fonts and page layouts.",
"Men yangi loyiha yoki kampaniya uchun o'ziga xos g'oya o'ylab topishni yoqtiraman.": "I like coming up with an original idea for a new project or campaign.",
"Men murakkab mavzuni boshqalarga sodda qilib tushuntirishni yoqtiraman.": "I like explaining complex topics to others in simple words.",
"Men birovga yangi ko'nikmani qadamma-qadam o'rganishda yordam berishni yoqtiraman.": "I like helping someone learn a new skill step by step.",
"Men odamlar bilan muloqot qilish, mehmonlarni kutib olish yoki sayohatni tanishtirishni yoqtiraman.": "I like talking with people, welcoming guests or showing travellers around.",
"Men odamning ehtiyojini tinglab, unga mos yechim yoki xizmatni tavsiya qilishni yoqtiraman.": "I like listening to what someone needs and recommending a solution or service.",
"Men o'z g'oyamni boshqalarga taqdim etib, ularni qo'llab-quvvatlashga undashni yoqtiraman.": "I like presenting my idea and persuading others to support it.",
"Men yangi loyiha yoki kichik biznesni boshlab, keyingi qadamlarni belgilashni yoqtiraman.": "I like starting a new project or small business and planning the next steps.",
